ika messenger application, or to find a contact/chat and send a message in Rubika on Windows.", "skill_file_path": "C:\\Users\\Parspano\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\open-rubika\\SKILL.md", "date_taught": "2026-09-15", "repo_url": "", "status": "active"}, {"name": "open-soroush", "description": "Use when the user asks to open or launch the Soroush Plus messenger application, or to find a contact/chat and send a message in Soroush Plus on Windows.", "skill_file_path": "C:\\Users\\Parspano\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\open-soroush\\SKILL.md", "date_taught": "2026-09-15", "repo_url": "", "status": "active"}], "registry_repo": "https://github.com/javadhamed-ctrl/jj-skills.git"
